inshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005","mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0029","quote":"鑒"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005","mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0044","quote":"樂安王鑒"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005","mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0208","quote":"鑒"}],"identity_note":"038文帝九男明列；姓司馬依已核文帝昭父系來源，列序不當排行。新來源角色，不以同字舊人接合。\n固定此數位見證明名來源人物；同指與跨記差異依各來源qualification，不由角色數宣稱必為異人。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","source_assertion_id":"a-jin038-wen-you-jian-father","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-nine-you-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-nine-you-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-nine-you-rendered:p001","quote":"文帝九男，文明王皇后生武帝、齊獻王攸、城陽哀王兆、遼東悼惠王定國、廣漢殤王廣德，其樂安平王鑒、燕王機、皇子永祚、樂平王延祚不知母氏。燕王機繼清惠亭侯，別有傳。永祚早亡，無傳。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-nine-you-rendered:p001:m0041","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-nine-you-rendered:p001:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"九男明父鏈；ID子支不是排行，不以列表順序補ordinal。\n依本源明示生父接既有司馬鈞家族；ID字母只為唯一子支位置，不代表出生排行。收繼與母系另存，不改生父。"},"historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","allocator_role_key":"jian"},{"id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIFA","label":"司馬籍","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","identity_note":"固定此數位見證明名來源人物；同指與跨記差異依各來源qualification，不由角色數宣稱必為異人。","review":"ai_provisional","allocator_role_key":"ji_jian_son","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIF","source_assertion_id":"a-jin038-children-ji-jian-father-jian","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005","quote":"樂安平王鑒，字大明，初封臨泗亭侯。武帝踐阼，封樂安王。帝為鑒及燕王機高選師友，下詔曰：「樂安王鑒、燕王機並以長大，宜得輔導師友，取明經儒學，有行義節儉，使足嚴憚。昔韓起與田蘇遊而好善，宜必得其人。」泰始中，拜越騎校尉。咸甯初，以齊之梁鄒益封，因之國，服侍中之服。元康初，徵為散騎常侍、上軍大將軍，領射聲校尉。尋遷使持節、都督豫州軍事、安南將軍，代清河王遐鎮許昌，以疾不行。七年薨，子殤王籍立。薨，無子，齊王冏以子冰紹鑒後。以濟陰萬一千二百一十九戶改為廣陽國，立冰為廣陽王。冏敗，廢。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0000","source_term":"子殤王籍"}],"interpretation_note":"真生父雙錨。繼爵先代不作生父；子支字母不表排行。\n依本源明示生父接既有司馬鈞家族；ID字母只為唯一子支位置，不代表出生排行。收繼與母系另存，不改生父。"},"aliases":[{"surface":"殤王籍","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005","mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191","quote":"殤王籍"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-038-wen-children-rendered:p005:m0191"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occ